# The one setting for the live demo (read by the simulator and the edge node).
#   manual : you inject faults and acknowledge alarms yourself (Node-RED buttons or mosquitto_pub)
#   auto   : the simulator injects a shock, a noise burst and a drift every 120 s, and a simulated operator acknowledges after 10 s
# After changing it: docker compose up -d --force-recreate simulator edge
DEMO_MODE=auto
